{"ex-E401-1":{"id":"ex-E401-1","chapter":"E401","number":1,"title":"兩個物體能被分辨嗎？","question":"<p>小雅用一隻眼睛觀察兩支紫色筆的筆尖，兩個筆尖會反射 420 nm 的光。筆尖之間的距離是 1 cm，與眼睛的距離是 70 m。</p><p>小雅眼睛的瞳孔直徑為 3 mm。</p><p>(a) 兩個筆尖相對於小雅眼睛的角間距是多少？</p><p>(b) 試證明小雅的眼睛無法分辨兩個筆尖。</p><p>(c) 試描述小雅應怎樣改變以下的量，才能令眼睛分辨兩個筆尖。</p><p>(i) 兩個筆尖之間的距離</p><p>(ii) 小雅的眼睛與筆尖的距離</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/b720a7b13ed0a01d2b626a0a.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:409.3px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) θ ≈ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>u</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{x}{u}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>0.01</mn><mn>70</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{0.01}{70}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 1.43 × 10<sup>−4</sup> rad</p><p>兩個筆尖相對於小雅眼睛的角間距是 1.43 × 10<sup>−4</sup> rad。</p><p>(b) θ<sub>R</sub> ≈ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.22</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1.22λ}{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.22</mn><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>420</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1.22 \\times  (420 \\times  10^{-9})}{3 \\times  10^{-3}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 1.71 × 10<sup>−4</sup> rad</p><p>由於 θ &lt; θ<sub>R</sub>，所以小雅的眼睛無法分辨兩個筆尖。</p><p>(c) (i) 小雅應增加兩個筆尖之間的距離。</p><p>(ii) 小雅應減少筆尖和眼睛之間的距離。</p>","tips":"","think":"<p>如果把紫色筆換成紅色筆，會否更容易分辨兩個筆尖？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>不會。紅光的波長比紫光長。瞳孔直徑相同時，衍射極限 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>θ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> 增加，而兩個筆尖的角距不變，因此更難分辨。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E401_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"f628690c22119951d4be1e8b4e33bd74267a78c9e9beb1136b53165054554578","segments":[{"page":18,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,53.49989511718741,557.4491,387.4043884277344],"text":"例 題 1 兩個物體能被分辨嗎？\r\n小雅用一隻眼睛觀察兩支紫色筆的筆尖，兩個筆尖會反射 420 nm 的\r\n光。筆尖之間的距離是 1 cm，與眼睛的距離是 70 m。\r\n1 cm\r\n70 m\r\n小雅眼睛的瞳孔直徑為 3 mm。\r\n(a) 兩個筆尖相對於小雅眼睛的角間距是多少？\r\n(b) 試證明小雅的眼睛無法分辨兩個筆尖。\r\n(c) 試描述小雅應怎樣改變以下的量，才能令眼睛分辨兩個筆尖。\r\n(i) 兩個筆尖之間的距離\r\n(ii) 小雅的眼睛與筆尖的距離\r\n"},{"page":18,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,387.4043884277344,557.4491,652.9408951171876],"text":"題解\r\n(a) θ ≈ x\r\nu\r\n = 0.01\r\n70\r\n = 1.43 × 10 − 4\r\n rad\r\n兩個筆尖相對於小雅眼睛的角間距是 1.43 × 10 − 4\r\n rad。\r\n(b) θ R ≈ 1.22λ\r\nd = 1.22 × (420 × 10–9)\r\n3 × 10–3\r\n = 1.71 × 10 − 4\r\n rad\r\n由於 θ < θ R，所以小雅的眼睛無法分辨兩個筆尖。\r\n(c) (i) 小雅應增加兩個筆尖之間的距離。\r\n(ii) 小雅應減少筆尖和眼睛之間的距離。\r\n"},{"page":18,"kind":"answer","box":[177.4488,642.3910951171875,560.4488,715.1050951171875],"text":"想一想\r\n如果以紅色筆取代紫色筆，會較容易分辨兩個筆尖嗎？\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","englishAlignedFields":["tips","think","thinkAnswer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E401-2":{"id":"ex-E401-2","chapter":"E401","number":2,"title":"眼睛折射部分的焦強","question":"<p>正常眼睛的視覺調節範圍是從眼前 25 cm 處至無窮遠處。已知眼睛折射部分的最小焦強為 +40 D。</p><p>(a) 正常眼睛分別看着置於近點和遠點的物體時，晶體對應的焦強是怎樣的？</p><p>(b) 求正常眼睛視網膜與折射部分的光心之間的距離 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 眼睛看着置於近點的物體時，晶體的焦強最大。</p><p>眼睛看着置於遠點的物體時，晶體的焦強最小。</p><p>(b) 應用 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{f}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{u}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。當 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span> = ∞，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> = +40 D，</p><p>40 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{∞}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.025 m (2.5 cm)</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E401_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"f628690c22119951d4be1e8b4e33bd74267a78c9e9beb1136b53165054554578","segments":[{"page":24,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,418.51689511718746,557.4491,579.8329925537109],"text":"例 題 2 眼睛折射部分的焦強\r\n正常眼睛的視覺調節範圍是從眼前 25 cm 處至無窮遠處。已知眼睛折\r\n射部分的最小焦強為 +40 D。\r\n(a) 正常眼睛分別看着置於近點和遠點的物體時，晶體對應的焦強是\r\n怎樣的？\r\n(b) 求正常眼睛視網膜與折射部分的光心之間的距離 d。\r\n"},{"page":24,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,579.8329925537109,557.4491,743.3698951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 眼睛看着置於近點的物體時，晶體的焦強最大。\r\n眼睛看着置於遠點的物體時，晶體的焦強最小。\r\n(b) 應用 P = 1\r\nf\r\n = 1\r\nu\r\n + \r\n1\r\nv\r\n。當 u = ∞，P = +40 D，\r\n 40 = 1\r\n∞\r\n + \r\n1\r\nd\r\nd = 0.025 m (2.5 cm)\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E401-3":{"id":"ex-E401-3","chapter":"E401","number":3,"title":"糾正近視","question":"<p>子傑患有近視，因此佩戴鏡片焦強為 −1.25 D 的眼鏡來糾正視力。</p><p>(a) 圖 a 和 b 分別顯示他沒有佩戴眼鏡和佩戴了眼鏡的情況。完成光線路徑，以顯示它們怎樣到達視網膜。</p><p>圖 a</p><p>圖 b</p><p>(b) 求子傑未經糾正的遠點與他眼睛的距離。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/c96b88afba0047627dd8648a.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:316.7px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a)</p><p>(b) 遙遠物體 (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span> = ∞) 通過眼鏡 (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> = − 1.25 D) 在未經糾正的遠點(<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> = ?) 形成像。</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{u}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>− 1.25 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{∞}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> = − 0.8 m 子傑未經糾正的遠點與他眼睛的距離是 0.8 m。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/e3af6a1fc306773c43e98275.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:316.6px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E401_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"f628690c22119951d4be1e8b4e33bd74267a78c9e9beb1136b53165054554578","segments":[{"page":32,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,53.49989511718752,557.4491,404.26336669921875],"text":"例 題 3 糾正近視\r\n子傑患有近視，因此佩戴鏡片焦強為 −1.25 D 的眼鏡來糾正視力。\r\n(a) 圖 a 和 b 分別顯示他沒有佩戴眼鏡和佩戴了眼鏡的情況。完成光\r\n線路徑，以顯示它們怎樣到達視網膜。\r\n圖 a\r\n圖 b\r\n透鏡\r\n(b) 求子傑未經糾正的遠點與他眼睛的距離。\r\n"},{"page":32,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,404.26336669921875,557.4491,744.0358951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a)\r\n(b) 遙遠物體 (u = ∞) 通過眼鏡 (P = − 1.25 D) 在未經糾正的遠點\r\n(v = ?) 形成像。\r\n P = 1\r\nu\r\n + \r\n1\r\nv\r\n − 1.25 = 1\r\n∞ + \r\n1\r\nv\r\n v = − 0.8 m\r\n子傑未經糾正的遠點與他眼睛的距離是 0.8 m。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E401-4":{"id":"ex-E401-4","chapter":"E401","number":4,"title":"糾正遠視","question":"<p>遠視眼觀看位於其近點的物體時，焦強 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 為 +50.25 D。眼睛視網膜與折射部分的光心相距 2 cm。</p><p>(a) 佩戴眼鏡後，近點糾正至距離眼睛 25 cm 的位置。求眼鏡鏡片的焦強 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(b) 求糾正後的眼睛觀看位於其近點的物體時，眼睛的有效焦強 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{eff}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 位於未經糾正的近點的物體 (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span> = ?) 通過未經糾正的眼睛(<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> = +50.25 D) 在視網膜上 (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.02 m) 形成像。</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{u}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>+50.25 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{u}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>0.02</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{0.02}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 4 m 未經糾正的近點離眼睛 4 m。</p><p>位於糾正後的近點的物體 (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.25 m) 通過眼鏡 (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>) 在未經糾正的近點 (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> = −4 m) 形成像。</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{u}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>0.25</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{0.25}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = +3.75 D</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{eff}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 50.25 + 3.75</p><p>= +54 D</p>","tips":"","think":"<p>你能否在不求 P₁ 的情況下求出 Pₑff？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>可以。把矯正後的眼睛與眼鏡視為單一光學系統。位於 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>u</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 的物體必須在位於 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 的視網膜上成像，因此 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>P</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>eff</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>u</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>D</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E401_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"f628690c22119951d4be1e8b4e33bd74267a78c9e9beb1136b53165054554578","segments":[{"page":33,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718752,562.4491,214.81585693359375],"text":"例 題 4 糾正遠視\r\n遠視眼觀看位於其近點的物體時，焦強 P0 為 +50.25 D。眼睛視網膜\r\n與折射部分的光心相距 2 cm。\r\n(a) 佩戴眼鏡後，近點糾正至距離眼睛 25 cm 的位置。求眼鏡鏡片的\r\n焦強 P1。\r\n(b) 求糾正後的眼睛觀看位於其近點的物體時，眼睛的有效焦強 Peff。\r\n"},{"page":33,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,214.81585693359375,562.4491,570.3528951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 位於未經糾正的近點的物體 (u = ?) 通過未經糾正的眼睛\r\n(P = +50.25 D) 在視網膜上 (v = 0.02 m) 形成像。\r\n P = 1\r\nu\r\n + \r\n1\r\nv\r\n +50.25 = 1\r\nu\r\n + \r\n1\r\n0.02\r\n u = 4 m\r\n未經糾正的近點離眼睛 4 m。\r\n位於糾正後的近點的物體 (u = 0.25 m) 通過眼鏡 (P = P1) 在未經\r\n糾正的近點 (v = −4 m) 形成像。\r\n P = 1\r\nu\r\n + \r\n1\r\nv\r\nP1 = 1\r\n0.25 + \r\n1\r\n–4\r\nP1 = +3.75 D\r\n(b) Peff = P0 + P1\r\n = 50.25 + 3.75 \r\n = +54 D\r\n"},{"page":33,"kind":"answer","box":[182.4488,559.8027951171874,565.4488,629.4927951171875],"text":"想一想\r\n你能在未求得 P1 的情況下找出 Peff 嗎？\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","englishAlignedFields":["thinkAnswer","tips","think"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E401-5":{"id":"ex-E401-5","chapter":"E401","number":5,"title":"光纖包覆層的折射率","question":"<p>右圖顯示的光纖由纖心和包覆層組成，纖心的折射率為 1.6。如果要光線不在纖心和包覆層之間的界面逸出，入射角最小須為 55°。</p><p>求包覆層的折射率。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/cc44f2be9f6b456565a288a3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:193.8px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>根據斯涅耳定律，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ<sub>1</sub> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ<sub>2</sub></p><p>1.6 sin 55° = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin 90°</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.31 包覆層的折射率是 1.31。</p>","tips":"","think":"<p>光纖的一部分浸在折射率為 1.47 的油中。這會否影響光線在光纖內的全內反射？如果光纖沒有外層包層，情況又會如何？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>包層完整時，纖芯與包層界面的全內反射不受影響：界面兩側的折射率仍為 1.6 和 1.31，因此臨界角維持 55°。</p><p>沒有包層時，油直接接觸纖芯。纖芯與油界面的臨界角為 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>sin</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></math>，相比之下，裸纖芯與空氣界面的臨界角為 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>sin</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></math>。在油中，只有入射角大於 66.7° 的光線仍會發生全內反射；入射角較小的光線可能漏出。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E401_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"f628690c22119951d4be1e8b4e33bd74267a78c9e9beb1136b53165054554578","segments":[{"page":40,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,367.14689511718746,557.4491,522.4629821777344],"text":"例 題 5 光纖包覆層的折射率\r\n右圖顯示的光纖由纖心和包覆層組成，纖\r\n心的折射率為 1.6。如果要光線不在纖心\r\n和包覆層之間的界面逸出，入射角最小須\r\n為 55°。\r\n求包覆層的折射率。\r\n"},{"page":40,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,522.4629821777344,557.4491,670.9998951171875],"text":"題解\r\n根據斯涅耳定律，\r\nn1 sin θ 1 = n2 sin θ 2\r\n 1.6 sin 55° = n2 sin 90°\r\nn2 = 1.31\r\n包覆層的折射率是 1.31。\r\n(n = 1.6) 55° 纖心\r\n包覆層\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","englishAlignedFields":["thinkAnswer","tips","think"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}